          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "2r - right side",
          "value": "<p>may God give them strength\u2014shall take steps to help you, assist you, grant you and support you. The noble signature at the top of it [= this document] is a proof of the necessity of [obeying] it, if God wills. A gracious injunction was written in g\u030cum\u0101d\u0101 I of the year 589.</p>\n<p>Praise is [due] to God alone.</p>\n<p>It was communicated to the public in rag\u030cab of the said year.</p>\n<p></p>",
